  <description>
    <p>
      Macaque Dock is a customizable desktop dock designed for
      KDE Plasma 6 and Wayland.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Launchpad-style application launcher</li>
      <li>Drag-and-drop launcher reordering</li>
      <li>Custom application icons</li>
      <li>Folder stacks with previews</li>
      <li>Configurable colors and transparency</li>
      <li>KWin blur integration</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

